description:
V23 · Panel as a VS Code tree. Same as V22, but the session's Customizations panel uses VS Code view controls:
- a Filter box and a title toolbar (Discover, Manage, Customize Panel, Collapse All) replace the footer links;
- uppercase pane-style section headers with a muted summary (cost, "3 of 5 on") and a count badge for problems;
- one-line rows with a muted description, a warning or error decoration, and inline icon actions on hover (Sign In or Show Output, Turn Off/On for This Session, More Actions);
- a context menu on every row.
